  "additionalProperties": false,
  "$id": "https://raid.gamernight.net/contracts/companion/bg3-save/v1/schema.json",
  "title": "RL Companion bg3-save message v1",
  "description": "GENERATED from Bg3SaveMessageSchema (packages/contract/src/companion-bg3-save.schema.ts) — do not edit by hand. Refinements enforced by the Zod schema but not expressible here: a party member's xpLevel ≤ xpTotal; isSummon ⇒ classes is empty; !isSummon ⇒ at least one class; payload.savedAt ≤ capturedAt. The server alone checks the clock; see CONTRACT.md."
}
